<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Thou Countenance transcendent!</l><l>Thou life-creating Sun!</l><l>To worlds on Thee dependent—</l><l>Yet bruised and spit upon</l><l>O Lord, what Thee tormented</l><l>Was our sins’ heavy load,</l><l>We had the debt augmented</l><l>Which Thou didst pay in blood.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We give Thee thanks unfeigned,</l><l>O Savior, Friend in need,</l><l>For what Thy soul sustained</l><l>When Thou for us didst bleed.</l><l>Grant us to lean unshaken</l><l>Upon Thy faithfulness,</l><l>Until, to glory taken,</l><l>We see Thee face to face.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
